playName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"1. 核心瓶頸是「Trust」：開發速度已經不是問題，難的是你有多信任 Agent?你夠信任他，才敢放手讓他自主做事，也才能降低人介入的比率。\n\n2. 定義邊界與風險：Agent 自己 review 完沒問題，不代表真的沒問題。 要確實定義 one-way-door / two-way-door, 以及爆掉時的 Blast Radius。\n\n3. 眼見為憑 ＆ Context：不能相信 AI 說測試完成了，強制要求附上截圖或是recording，同時在 Review 時加入歷史 ticket + 相關的 bug context。\n\n4. 被拒的 PR 超級珍貴：要記錄下 Agent 開的 PR 被工程師 Reject 時留下的「Why」，是讓系統進化的關鍵。透過 Feedback Loop，繼續回饋優化Harness Quality!","timestamp":"2026-10-29T11:03:54.000Z","stats":{"likes":18,"replies":2,"reposts":0,"shares":10},"score":22,"first_seen":"2026-10-31T00:36:50+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfE205VjZT3","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/DfE205VjZT3","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"附上兩隻超有料精華影片：\nyoutube.com/watch…","timestamp":"2026-10-29T11:03:57.000Z","stats":{"likes":9,"replies":1,"reposts":1,"shares":4},"score":14,"first_seen":"2026-10-31T00:36:50+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfE21ZajXFc","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/DfE21ZajXFc","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"youtube.com/watch…","timestamp":"2026-10-29T11:04:01.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":1,"shares":2},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-10-31T00:36:50+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@darrell_tw_","posts":[{"id":"DfHvQpIAcNH","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DfHvQpIAcNH","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"Firstrade 不要以為你用貓咪賣萌的 500 error 就可以\n看了一下又不是熔斷\n怎麼 Firstrade 自己先燒掉了\n\n用 app 進不去的人可以嘗試用網頁版，比較有機會進的去","timestamp":"2026-10-30T13:55:34.000Z","stats":{"likes":6,"replies":2,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":10,"first_seen":"2026-10-31T03:52:42+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfGuj9CkUsI","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DfGuj9CkUsI","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"當初做股票的 mods \n不是為了看到這個...","timestamp":"2026-10-30T04:30:13.000Z","stats":{"likes":16,"replies":3,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":22,"first_seen":"2026-10-31